OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will start rather cloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain. An isolated shower
OL,7,Fis possible during the remainder of
OL,8,Fthe day, though most areas will become
OL,9,Fdry with skies brightening at times in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine, though breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAn isolated light shower is
OL,14,Fstill possible during the evening and
OL,15,Finto the overnight period, though for
OL,16,Fmany it will become dry. Clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. A mild, though breezy
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
