OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMonday will be a generally dry
OL,6,Fday across the region with bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Some more prolonged
OL,8,Fsunshine is possible later. Becoming
OL,9,Fvery warm in lighter winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,12,Fweather looks generally dry and
OL,13,Fsettled through the period. There will
OL,14,Fbe plenty of sunshine, and
OL,15,Ftemperatures will creep back up, so
OL,16,Ffeeling hotter, with winds remaining
OL,17,Flight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
